  "lovable_home": {
    "text_01": "Product",
    "text_02": "Research",
    "text_03": "Origin",
    "text_04": "Register",
    "text_05": "Shop",
    "text_06": "Cart",
    "text_07": "NUTRITION. WITH SATIETY IN MIND.",
    "text_08": "The pouch · 160 g",
    "text_09": "Unflavoured sacha inchi powder. Protein and fibre from one seed, made for everyday use.",
    "text_10": "mix it",
    "text_11": "drink it",
    "text_12": "feel it",
    "text_13": "120",
    "text_14": "kcal / 30 g",
    "text_15": "66%",
    "text_16": "protein",
    "text_17": "14%",
    "text_18": "fibre",
    "text_19": "0%",
    "text_20": "additives",
    "text_21": "Common problem",
    "text_22": "The hunger loop.",
    "text_23": "10 pm — 11 pm",
    "text_24": "Dinner is over. You open the cupboard. One cookie. Then another. Before you know it, the package is empty.",
    "text_25": "Then comes the guilt. The next morning, you wake up regretting it.",
    "text_26": "Our approach",
    "text_27": "Put satiety first.",
    "text_28": "Satiety is the feeling of fullness that lasts after eating.",
    "text_29": "inchy is a sacha inchi nutraceutical focused on satiety, bringing protein and fibre together in a format you can add to everyday foods and drinks.",
    "text_30": "01",
    "text_31": "The nutraceutical",
    "text_32": "What is inchy?",
    "text_33": "Protein + fibre.",
    "text_34": "One remarkable seed.",
    "text_35": "inchy is an unflavoured sacha inchi powder made for everyday use. Through a proprietary process developed over years, we bring the seed",
    "text_36": "'",
    "text_37": "s protein and fibre together in one functional ingredient designed to mix into food or drinks. One preparation. Both components.",
    "text_38": "Format",
    "text_39": "Unflavoured powder",
    "text_40": "Contains",
    "text_41": "No sweeteners. No flavours. No additives.",
    "text_42": "Net weight",
    "text_43": "160 g / 5.64 oz",
    "text_44": "Sacha inchi, Colombia · fair trade",
    "text_45": "02",
    "text_46": "The research",
    "text_47": "Satiety. GLP-1.",
    "text_48": "Nutrient research",
    "text_49": "Protein and certain dietary fibres can stimulate the body",
    "text_50": "s own release of GLP-1, a gut hormone involved in appetite regulation.",
    "text_51": "These are findings about particular nutrients and study preparations. They do not establish the GLP-1 response to a serving of inchy.",
    "text_52": "Laboratory research",
    "text_53": "Sacha inchi peptides.",
    "text_54": "Peptides derived from sacha inchi meal inhibited DPP-IV in laboratory tests. DPP-IV is an enzyme that breaks down GLP-1.",
    "text_55": "Zhang et al. · 2023 · Laboratory study. This was not a human trial of finished inchy and does not establish effects on appetite or GLP-1 in people taking inchy.",
    "text_56": "03",
    "text_57": "The routine",
    "text_58": "Make it part of your day.",
    "text_59": "in yogurt",
    "text_60": "in oats",
    "text_61": "in a drink",
    "text_62": "Our process turns sacha inchi into a versatile ingredient. Add it to yogurt, oats or a drink you already enjoy. Measure the serving stated on your pouch and mix thoroughly.",
    "text_63": "05",
    "text_64": "In development",
    "text_65": "inchy chock.",
    "text_66": "The same seed, pressed into a bar. Cacao, sacha inchi protein and fibre. Nothing else. For the hours when a spoon is not an option.",
    "text_67": "06",
    "text_68": "A small seed. A world of possibility.",
    "text_69": "Rooted in biodiversity.",
    "text_70": "Heart-shaped leaves. A star-shaped fruit. Within it, a seed with a 3,000-year history of use. A story that began long before inchy.",
    "text_71": "Plukenetia volubilis, known as sacha inchi, belongs to tropical South America. Today our story begins with farmers in Colombia and the care they bring to every harvest.",
    "text_72": "Premium sacha inchi was difficult to source. That is why we helped establish a growers association, united by a shared commitment to quality and paid on fair trade terms — every seed we buy comes from it, with no other sourcing. Nature gives us the starting point. Our process gives it a new form: protein and fibre together in one powder.",
    "text_73": "U.S. launch coming soon.",
    "text_74": "Be first to hear when inchy is available to order in the United States.",
    "text_75": "Register first for order →",
    "text_76": "Register first for order",
    "text_77": "First pouches. First served.",
    "text_78": "Pay with",
    "text_79": "inchy",
    "text_80": "Open menu",
    "text_81": "inchy 160 g sacha inchi pouch",
    "text_82": "inchy chock bar wrapper",
    "text_83": "Sacha inchi star-shaped pods on the vine",
    "name": "Name",
    "email": "Email",
    "register": "Register",
    "success": "Thanks for registering. If you receive a confirmation email, follow its link to finish subscribing.",
    "skip": "Skip to content",
    "cloud_number": "04",
    "cloud_status": "In development",
